    // -------------------------------------------------------------
    // FILE OPERATIONS — unified via /api/printer/files/*
    // -------------------------------------------------------------
    // opts: { fresh, page, per_page, sort, dir, search, only_new }
    // Search, sorting and paging are done by the adapter server-side across the
